# List Toolbar Pattern

For list pages with filters or controls, group them in a toolbar area below the card header.

## Principles

- Place filters/controls in a dedicated toolbar section (between header and content)
- Use `v-spacer` to push actions to the right when needed
- Toolbar clusters: `d-flex align-center flex-wrap` + `style="gap: 8px"` (not Vuetify `ga-*`)
- Filters should auto-apply with debouncing; avoid requiring an Apply button
- Add/Create buttons belong in the **section header**, right-aligned — not in the toolbar and never below the list

## Form Inputs in Toolbar

- `variant="outlined"`
- `density="compact"`
- `hide-details="auto"`
- `style="max-width: 200px;"` or similar for fixed-width filters
